{"version":1,"key":"card:256","content":{"id":256,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"当我们调用自己创建的对象的 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"toString","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 方法时，得到的是 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"[object Object]","code":true}]},{"type":"code-block","code":"let Person = {\n  name: \"Alice\",\n};\n\nconsole.log(Person.toString()); // [object Object]","language":"JavaScript","uuid":"e3fef0bb-08a1-4fc1-b48c-c84b1723e41a","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"如果我们希望打印出 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"[object Person]","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"，那么可以借助于 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"Symbol.toStringTag","code":true}]},{"type":"code-block","code":"let Person = {\n  name: \"Alice\",\n};\n\nPerson[Symbol.toStringTag] = \"Person\";\n\nconsole.log(Person.toString()); // [object Person]","language":"JavaScript","uuid":"effd009b-06d9-4301-8455-c6909e7bb6bc","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}],"tags":["JavaScript/Symbol"],"createTime":1690987246387,"updateTime":1743303640421,"linkedCards":[{"id":249,"target":{"key":"card:249","type":"card","id":249},"summary":"Symbol 是 ES6 引入的一种新的原始类型，类型的值唯一的，每个被创建出来的 Symbol 变量都是不同的，这是 Symbol 这种数据类型最大的特点，常常用于作为对象的属性，以防止被不正确篡改。 Symbol 不能通过字面量来进行创...","tags":["JavaScript/Symbol"]}]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1743303640421}}